    "excerpt": "We live in a confusing and chaotic time. We have adopted tools that we did not know existed two years ago and today we use them with ease. With home office or teleworking we have developed the ability to learn quickly, so quickly that sometimes very important details escape us. We think that someone can work from...",
    "content": "<p>We live in a confusing and chaotic time. We have adopted tools that we did not know existed two years ago and today we use them with ease. With the <em>home office</em> or teleworking we have developed the ability to learn quickly, so quickly that sometimes <strong>We miss very important details.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>We think that someone can work from home with only a computer and an internet connection, but <strong>we are very far from reality</strong>. That is why I would like to touch on some challenges that remote work has imposed that should not be taken lightly.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Security Information</strong><strong>to</strong><strong>ethics</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Being connected to your home WiFi network is not enough as it could be <strong>potentially dangerous</strong> if sensitive company information is handled. It is important that all this data travels in an encrypted manner. How is this achieved? Very simple: with a network <strong>VPN</strong>. This way you can send and receive files securely from anywhere. This is achieved by masking your IP and encrypting data traffic from point A to point B.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Use of Authorized Applications</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>You must ensure that your employees make use of the tools provided by the company. Most of the time, for convenience, the work team shares sensitive information through personal accounts (via WhatsApp or Gmail). <strong>It is vital that you only use allowed applications</strong> and, above all, provide them. Take care not to expose yourself or your company to computer attacks</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Secure the</strong><strong>EITHER</strong><strong>optimal performance</strong><strong>size of your Workforce</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>One of the biggest challenges – and fears – for companies is the lack of productivity of their employees due to teleworking. a network <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3I70z4F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SD-WAN</a> can solve this problem. Being a cloud-based system with an SD-WAN network, it is possible <strong>check your team's work in real time</strong>, know connection and disconnection times and have a <strong>secure network</strong> for the exchange of information.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Not everything is challenges</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>In many cases it has been shown that the <strong>remote work is a benefit</strong>. Companies have obtained savings of up to 35% (especially for electricity and water expenses) and according to a <a href=\"https://www.forbes.com.mx/home-office-aumenta-28-la-productividad-de-las-empresas/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">study</a> of COPARMEX <em>“The productivity of employees who work from home increased approximately 28%.”</em> This shows us that, <strong>be implemented correctly</strong>, the home office could be the business future.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>A</strong><strong>to V</strong><strong>Competitive advantage</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>By working with completely cloud-based systems you gain the possibility of <strong>recruit staff nationally</strong>(and even international). This is a great opportunity to add highly trained people to your payroll with the necessary requirements.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>I hope these tips are useful for your company and help you <strong>raise awareness</strong> <strong>about</strong> <strong>the</strong> <strong>dangers</strong>, but also about the benefits of this modality that apparently is here to stay.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>At Vialterna our network <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3I70z4F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SD-WAN</a> offers you the solution to adapt to <strong>safe and intuitive way</strong> to the home office. Implementing our family of sensors <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3L0ySwq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">IoT</a> Your company will be covered in every way.</p>",
